class Tagged<T>(val n: int)
class Slot<T>(var value: T) { fun getValue(): T = value }
class Box<T>(val n: int, val tag: Tagged<T> = Tagged<T>(2), val saved: int by Slot(1))
fun main: int { val Tagged = { n: int -> n * 10 }; val box = Box<string>(n = 1); if (box.tag.n == 2 && box.saved == 1 && Tagged(1) == 10) 0 else 1 }
